{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqaripe9d7x","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"overlay save load field contract: local fields list and ready status sentinel","summary":"lib/overlay.js save() persists ONLY LOCAL_FIELDS to the overlay JSON; everything else must have a graph-store event in emitDiff() AND a rehydrate branch in load(), or it is silently dropped on every round-trip (the 942d50f refactor lost notes, guidance, optimize, epoch this way — now restored to LOCAL_FIELDS). Status deletion sentinel: emitDiff writes status_changed 'ready' when an override was DELETED (releaseClaim / verdict release) because the append-only log cannot express deletion; load() deliberately SKIPS replayed 'ready' so it never becomes an explicit override (an override short-circuits dep derivation in the scheduler at daemon.js effective()). Any new shared overlay field needs all three: emit, replay case in graph-store loadGraph, rehydrate in load().","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-12T10:07:14.961Z","vec":[0.026309369131922722,0.10537844151258469,-0.006967079825699329,0.06483957916498184,0.030392006039619446,0.042078904807567596,-0.0040635112673044205,0.033986639231443405,-0.034921158105134964,0.0393766425549984,0.004310163669288158,0.016276514157652855,-0.03546304628252983,-0.03518630564212799,-0.03912477195262909,0.06281489133834839,0.029192782938480377,-0.05088798329234123,-0.06375975906848907,-0.00331748160533607,-0.03874775394797325,0.010747285559773445,-0.020750466734170914,0.055891890078783035,0.014913232065737247,0.0613684244453907,-0.06458885222673416,-0.012341844849288464,0.03694850578904152,0.012785202823579311,-0.060097917914390564,0.02297564037144184,0.012962072156369686,0.031207703053951263,0.0363442599773407,0.10229391604661942,-0.05237885192036629,0.007527401205152273,-0.04383639618754387,0.06266113370656967,-0.01573285460472107,-0.05919448658823967,0.03353556990623474,0.0137604596093297,-0.017847636714577675,-0.05257027596235275,-0.01238430105